WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Battle Ship Takes Off!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.930
Domino Stadium.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:42.810
Only those who passed the Battle City prelims know that the finals will take place here.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:48.050
Champions will gather here with the title of Duel King at stake.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.450
Seven duelists are left.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:04.870
The first to arrive is Seto Kaiba, who has a God Card.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:14.440
Rishido, I hope you haven't forgotten the promise you made with my father.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.110
No.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:16.610
Good.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:24.240
I will free my family from our cursed fate that has lasted for 3,000 years.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.620
By ending Yugi's life.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:32.700
In ancient Egypt, Pharaohs made their people build the Pyramids.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:41.150
They pointed towards the sunlight and symbolized the absolute power of the Pharaohs.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:47.340
But there were those in power who secretly worshipped the darkness, creating strife.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:53.050
Magicians created seven Items to seal away the darkness.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:59.560
Among them was the Millennium Puzzle, an upside-down pyramid that symbolized darkness.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:06.060
In order to keep the darkness sealed, my family had to make many sacrifices.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:15.590
Prophecy states that the evil power and the young Pharaoh's soul were sealed away together.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:22.110
But after several thousand years, the evil power will begin to resurrect.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:28.590
And the Pharaoh's soul will also awaken, searching the world for his memories.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:32.320
I hold the key to the location of his memories.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.990
I won't let him have his memories back.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:42.340
I'll use the power of the Sun God Ra to bury him in darkness again.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:46.500
That's the only way I can gain freedom.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:49.820
Isono, turn on the lights.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:50.320
Huh?

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.340
Light up the bleachers!

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.420
Yes, sir!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.940
Turn on the lights!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:17.060
Big brother, Yugi's group has arrived.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.700
This is the finals?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.920
It's still under construction.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.920
We're really dueling here?

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.710
Welcome to the finals.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.530
You three are accepted into the final tournament.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.850
Obviously!

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:40.260
Congratulations.  Please take your ID cards.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.520
Where are the other duelists?

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.760
Only Seto and you three have arrived so far.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.340
Four left.

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.450
And one of them is Marik.

00:04:57.140 --> 00:05:00.510
Another duelist has arrived.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.720
Is he Marik?

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.420
That's...

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.930
Namu!

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.690
Hey, Namu!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.740
Are you okay?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.800
We were worried about you!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.200
I'm glad that you're fine too!

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.640
So what happened afterwards?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:30.210
He wanted me to teach him to duel when the Ghouls attacked us.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:34.710
They captured us, but not him.  Why?

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:40.050
I didn't have any rare cards that they wanted.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:44.160
Every incident happened after we met him.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.060
Can it be?

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:52.500
Yugi, let me introduce you to Namu.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:56.250
He helped us when the Ghouls attacked us.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.450
Right, Jonouchi?

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.100
Uhh, yeah!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.940
Nice to meet you.  I'm Namu.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.380
Hi.  You must be very skilled.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.980
You can't pass the prelims on luck alone.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:15.220
Actually, I feel intimidated to be surrounded by such great duelists.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.460
I'm imagining things.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.660
Bakura?  What's he doing here?

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.060
Bakura!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.060
Why are you here?

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.440
Bakura, are you all healed up?

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:37.860
My grandpa said that you lost a lot of blood.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.740
Yeah...

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.910
Get back to the hospital!

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.480
You're not healthy enough to come here!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:47.340
Why do you have a Duel Disk?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.420
To enter the finals, of course.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.470
What?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.660
Look.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:07:00.660
So Bakura managed to collect the Puzzle Cards in a short amount of time.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:06.140
I can't believe Bakura wants to participate in the tournament.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.140
When did you enter the prelims?

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:12.640
And win six Puzzle Cards?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.380
Is it him again?

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.200
Look.  It's the seventh duelist.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.820
That's Marik!

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.340
He has Ra.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.330
He's...

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.200
Are you Marik?

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.200
Correct.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.840
You punk!

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.700
I'll never forgive you!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.210
Want me to control you again?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:50.450
I want to pummel you right now, but we'll settle it later in a duel, fair and square!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:51.710
Be ready!

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:57.200
As the organizer of this tournament, I can disqualify you, Marik.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:02.960
But I won't because I'm going to crush you and get your God Card!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.080
Yeah!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.860
My brother will avenge everyone!

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.940
Even I can sense Marik's powerful fighting spirit.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.600
To the seven duelists, I have an announcement.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:29.780
By winning the prelims, you've arrived at Domino Stadium for the finals.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.460
But the finals won't take place here.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:39.130
The actual location will arrive soon.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.300
What?

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.630
The actual location?

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:45.610
What's up?

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.430
It has arrived.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.100
Wow!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.550
That's...

00:08:58.710 --> 00:08:59.860
An airship!

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.780
That's the location of the finals?

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:08.260
Yes.  It's the Battle Ship!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.930
Battle Ship?  Don't tell me we're...

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:12.490
Yup!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:16.500
The finals will take place 1000 meters in the air!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.420
Please step aboard.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.680
We will depart when the eighth duelist arrives.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:30.970
Dueling in the sky sounds fun!

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:31.540
Yeah.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.400
The Ghouls can't interfere if we're in the air.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.420
I'm getting fired up!  Let's go, Shizuka!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:42.140
Stop!  You can't get on without an ID card!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.160
No way!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:48.740
But I was looking forward to watching my brother duel in the finals...

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:49.660
C'mon now!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.540
Please!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.570
Let us on!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.420
Please!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.600
Pretty please!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.070
No means no.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.250
Hey!  I don't have an ID card either.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.680
Let them on.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.720
But Mokuba!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:03.910
Right, big brother?

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.480
Suit yourself.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.710
We accept your offer!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.980
Hey!

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.590
Ignore them.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:11.790
Yes, sir.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.330
Prepare for takeoff!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:21.060
But we only have seven duelists.  There's one opening left.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.430
I don't care.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.070
Everyone with a God Card is onboard.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.570
What do we do?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:32.740
Hmm...  The rules say we need eight duelists-

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:00.850
Good.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:11.140
Battle Ship, take off!

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:35.170
I get a whole view of the city!

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:39.130
Isn't it incredible to duel on an airship?

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.130
Yeah!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.170
Powerful duelists can even fly!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:48.930
For an ordinary duelist, you're in high spirits.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.800
Old and merry?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.920
I said "ordinary," idiot.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:58.490
The upcoming duels will be so cruel that it will chill you to the bone.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:03.000
Enjoy your sightseeing while you can.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:07.500
I'm gonna crush that punk in this tournament!

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.740
Yugi, a word of warning.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:19.980
You foolishly didn't include your God Card in your deck during Battle City.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:24.490
I figured that out during our tag match against the Ghouls.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:31.560
Don't you dare do that when we duel!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:39.300
You know that we're stepping into God's territory in this final tournament.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.520
The three God Cards will choose who is truly the strongest!

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.270
The legendary battle now begins!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.850
I will defeat you and Marik and acquire the God Cards.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.350
I will become the world's strongest duelist!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:09.200
We've prepared a room for each duelist.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.950
Use your ID card to enter your room.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.950
The tournament starts in an hour.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:19.340
We'll announce the matchups then.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.900
What a nice room!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.430
I can see the skyline!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:27.510
Yeah...

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.020
It's a river of lights.  It's beautiful.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:36.180
Brother, do you remember when you took me to the beach?

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.030
Of course.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.560
The glittering ocean was beautiful.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:50.800
Back then, I thought that I'd never be able to see something as beautiful with you again.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:54.780
Shizuka...

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:56.880
Brother...

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:02.020
Thanks to you, I'm able to see this beautiful view with you again.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:08.260
Of course!  And I'll show you even more beautiful sights!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:11.780
Thank you, brother.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.750
Shizuka, watch me.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.900
You've given me the courage to reach the final match.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:23.500
I'll defeat Yugi in a fair match and become a true duelist.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.510
Hey, you have a nice room!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.120
Why are you entering my room?

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:33.510
Because they don't have rooms for us.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.800
The fridge is stocked with food and drinks.

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.020
I'm hungry!

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:43.520
They even have room service!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.080
Get out of my room!  Except Shizuka!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.680
It's fine, brother.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.530
The more the merrier.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.450
Merrier?

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:56.310
Shizuka, a duelist is nervous before a duel.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:15:00.470
I'll invite Shizuka to see the beautiful view with me.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.170
Shizuka, want to see the beautiful view?

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:05.800
Okay.

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.550
Otogi!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.750
That must be Domino Pier.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:14.940
You're right!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:24.280
Jonouchi, sorry for ruining your precious time with Shizuka.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:28.280
Honda, if you knew that, why don't you go to another room?

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.570
Like Yugi's room!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:33.260
Don't be silly.  Yugi is busy preparing for his duel.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:34.980
I can't bother him.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.450
I'm a duelist too!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.180
Oh yeah.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:40.910
Sheesh...

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.460
Thanks, Honda.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.850
For bringing Shizuka.

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:49.860
Don't mention it.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:52.860
Just win, Jonouchi.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:53.940
Yeah.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.810
What do you want with my brother?

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.280
We're going to tell him that...

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.820
...the eighth duelist arrived.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.740
Don't bother him!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:17.250
You know that the time before a duel is important!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.750
I'm terribly sorry.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.820
The tournament finally begins.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.280
I'll defeat Yugi and Marik.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:34.770
I promise to acquire all three God Cards.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.350
All the duelists are worthy opponents.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:56.290
I didn't win Duelist Kingdom, but I'll win this time.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.030
I cannot afford to lose.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:06.670
For my family.  And for Master Marik.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.970
Master Marik...

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:24.650
Yugi, I'm happy that I could join your group.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.170
Good thing I had an ally ready.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.940
I can control her when I need to.

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:35.140
And I control another.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.180
Bakura.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:44.080
An evil presence is already inside him, but I'm in control of his normal self.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.170
My preparations are complete.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:53.740
Yugi, the carvings on my back show the location of your memories.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:56.550
But I won't let you regain your memories.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.920
Our Shadow Game will send you into eternal darkness.

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:05.930
And when I have all three God Cards, I will become the new Pharaoh!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.770
That's my ultimate goal for this battle!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:12.430
The 3000 year-old battle begins, Yugi!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:24.040
I must win to regain my other self's memories.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:28.050
The God Card Slifer the Sky Dragon...

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.550
I'll put the God Card in my deck.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:38.000
My other self's battle of destiny is about to start.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:39.500
Yeah.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:45.300
But will I really regain my memories when I win this battle?

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.350
Certainly.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:51.520
Marik has a Millennium Item and the Ra card.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.250
And Kaiba has Obelisk.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:03.600
The three Gods will clash in a fierce battle, and I promise to win!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.820
But I'm worried about two things.

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:10.570
The first is Bakura.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.680
Yeah.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:15.170
How was he able to enter the tournament?

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.880
How did he get a Duel Disk?

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.300
Not bloody enough.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:32.340
For an instant, Bakura's facial expression looked like he was controlled by the darkness.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:34.310
I felt that too.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:38.480
Bakura, I didn't know you were a Shadow Game duelist.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:42.650
Bakura?  I'm not Bakura.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.760
What do you want?

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:47.760
You should know, Yugi.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:53.700
Whoever collects all the Millennium Items will have the power to rule the world.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.350
Forgive me, Bakura.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:14.350
But Honda threw away the Millennium Ring at Duelist Kingdom, along with the darkness.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.550
Don't underestimate the dark powers of a Millennium Item.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.360
It may still be controlling Bakura.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.290
No way!

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.870
What's your other concern?

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:27.000
The eighth duelist.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.230
No one has seen this person.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:31.900
I was thinking the same thing.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.240
Who could it be?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:43.580
The first match will now begin.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.820
Duelists, report to the hall.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.320
Brother!

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.960
It's finally starting.  Let's go!

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:52.820
Yeah!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:00.600
I'm going to defeat him!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:03.600
Jonouchi.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:05.320
Hey, Namu.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:09.110
If we have to duel each other, go easy on me.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:14.610
Sorry.  I can't go easy on my opponent just because he's my friend.

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:18.120
You're right.  Let's duel with all our strength.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.350
Yeah!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:25.190
Even if Yugi is my opponent, I promise to win!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:29.630
Let's go, partner.

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.380
Yeah!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:49.870
Yugi and Bakura are matched up in the first duel of the finals.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.480
Sorry Bakura, but Yugi is going to win easily.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:58.960
Under strong winds, the two face off in the Duel Ring on the Battle Ship.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:01.930
Huh?  Bakura is acting strange.

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:04.460
That's the Millennium Ring!

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:06.860
His dark side has overtaken him again!

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:11.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
First Duel in the Sky
Yugi vs Yami Bakura

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.080
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:23.540
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:32.480
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:37.450
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:41.420
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:49.400
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:52.970
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:57.740
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.740 --> 00:23:07.850
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:15.460
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:24.430
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:32.410
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:42.250
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
